      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَجَهُ</span></b> : see 3. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَجَتْ</span>, (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَجَانٌ</span>,
